WEBVTT

00:07:30.434 --> 00:07:31.584
Shy?

00:07:31.927 --> 00:07:35.395
As if it hadn't taken all the courage
and confidence she had

00:07:35.419 --> 00:07:37.577
to say no to someone she liked.

00:07:37.926 --> 00:07:40.160
Whose feelings she did not want to hurt.

00:07:40.942 --> 00:07:42.409
But she said it again.

00:07:43.355 --> 00:07:44.505
She said no.

00:07:45.728 --> 00:07:47.528
Did he listen to her words?

00:07:49.768 --> 00:07:53.855
In the age of Me Too
and Time's Up, people ask me,

00:07:53.879 --> 00:07:56.331
"How do I even know
what my partner wants and likes?

00:07:56.355 --> 00:07:58.823
Is all consent to be verbal
and contractual now?"

00:07:58.847 --> 00:08:00.841
There are times when consent is ambiguous